<title>FRANCE: UAP insurance results breakdown.</title>
<headline>UAP insurance results breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>Following is a breakdown of UAP result in insurance:</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Total					  2,029  vs	   1,774</p>
<p>    Life					   1,079  vs	     804</p>
<p>    Non life					 950  vs	     970</p>
<p>Total by geographic unit:</p>
<p>    UAP France				     541  vs	     516</p>
<p>    UAP Europe central and east		310  vs	     292</p>
<p>    UAP Britain and Ireland		    450  vs	     385</p>
<p>    UAP Benelux, northern Europe	     402  vs	     404</p>
<p>    UAP International			    169  vs		75</p>
<p>    Scor					     127  vs		84</p>
<p>    Transversal activity			  30  vs		18</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
